# Git workflow

- Product work branches start from `origin/dev`.
- Use conventional branch names such as `feat/branch-list` or `fix/author-cache`.
- Pull requests target `dev`.
- The orphan `docs/vault` branch is updated only from its dedicated worktree.
- Never merge `docs/vault` into `dev` or `main`.
- Commit messages use Conventional Commits.
- Never force-push or bypass hooks unless the maintainer explicitly asks.
- `main` receives only release merges from `dev`.
